<title>THAILAND: Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</title>
<headline>Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading or announced at Bangkok port, the Thai tapioca association said.</p>
<p> Departure	    Charter	 Date	  Tonnes</p>
<p>SEA L		    (ACT)	 01/12/96     34,000</p>
<p>GOLDEN N GRAMPUS     (IAT)	 03/12/96     35,000</p>
<p>YA ZHOU HAI	    (ACT)	 06/12/96     50,000</p>
<p>In port</p>
<p>JIMILTA		  (IAT)	 12/12/96     27,000</p>
<p>PEARL SEA		(STC)	 17/12/96     30,000</p>
<p>SIAM SYLYTY	    (STC)	 28/12/96     41,000</p>
